 "case:hints.h_bench.levels.2": "On the board, answer ‘No: his watch never climbed, and never left his wrist’, with Joel’s watch file and the police summary (or the bench).",
 "case:hints.h_confirm.levels.0": "Somebody was in the Nest all evening, and everyone says they were somewhere else. Can they prove it?",
 "case:hints.h_confirm.levels.1": "Ask the people who say they were elsewhere whether anyone can confirm it, starting with Fiona.",
